window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The thrilling conclusion to the Sophie and the Odd Ones series….<br> <br> A cryptic message from the Great Mother sends Sophie on a mission to uncover her own dark past. This quest will lead her on a journey to the Queen Maeve’s former stronghold on Earth. Sophie soon discovers the shocking truth about her erased history and the destiny that awaits her.</p> <p>With the help of her loyal friends and newfound allies, she must journey to other realms to gather an army and confront the darkness that threatens to consume everything she holds dear. As Maeve's hybrid soldiers prepare to launch a full-scale attack on San Francisco, Sophie and her companions must prepare for the ultimate battle.<br> <br> With the fate of their world on the line, can Sophie finally come to terms with her true identity and embrace her destiny? Or will Sophie lose herself to her dark magic and darker past? Sophie must face her own fears and embrace her newfound abilities.<br> <br> In this epic finale, Gwen DeMarco masterfully weaves a tale of magic, adventure, and the power of friendship. <i>Odds and Ends</i>, the heart-pounding finale to the Sophie Feegle series, is filled with twists and turns that will keep you on the edge of your seat until the very last minute.</p>"; 
